API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7739436Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7746178Z ^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7746660Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7747043Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7747207Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7747359Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7748295Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7748501Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7748664Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7748958Z    if you are ready to continue.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7749085Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7749357Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7749760Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750102Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750358Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750497Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750630Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750814Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7750952Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7751225Z    can use Nix.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7751331Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7751420Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7751566Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7752055Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7752491Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7757513Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7757672Z I will:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7758109Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7758262Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7758570Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7758993Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7759367Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7759626Z  - install Nix in /nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7759884Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7760168Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7760398Z    /root
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7771083Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7771454Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7780467Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:00:38.7780785Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
