WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7154489Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7155457Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7155803Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7156066Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7158294Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7159600Z 
