WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7162090Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7163185Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7164844Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7165739Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7166506Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7166735Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7167021Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
