WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7168393Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7168600Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T17:01:18.7168753Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
